#: ../../quick-reference.rst:176
msgid ""
"*Upstream (proxy)*: ``X-Forwarded-For`` (socket peer, after the received "
"chain when trusted), ``X-Forwarded-Proto``, ``X-Real-IP`` (the judged "
"client), ``X-Sibuna-Status: PASS``, ``X-Sibuna-Rule: <rule>``; hop-by-hop "
"and alternative forwarding fields dropped, underscore spellings too."
msgstr ""
"*Hacia el origen (proxy)*: ``X-Forwarded-For`` (el par del socket, tras "
